1
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:04,700
He's too young.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,860
And he's your employee.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,140
What on earth are you thinking?

4
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,720
You guys are seriously dating, right?

5
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:18,740
- Right?
- What do you mean, "right"?

6
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:22,810
What else?

7
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:25,220
What's the deal with that kid?

8
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:28,760
He's super cute.

9
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:32,140
Right? Right?
It was love at first sight for me.

10
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:40,180
Even so, I still worry.

11
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,640
I know very well.

12
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:49,040
My next ten years
and Ai-chan's next ten years.

13
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:53,340
The speed and weight of time passing
are completely different.

14
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,000
That goes without saying.

15
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:59,260
He still has a long road ahead of him.

16
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:00,900
Yeah.

17
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:03,860
It's not like the time I have left.

18
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,800
Collapsing made me
realize that all over again.

19
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:10,740
But you don't want to let go just yet?

20
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,840
Until Ai-chan shakes me off,
I'll hold on to him tightly.

21
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:19,900
That's gross.

22
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:23,940
What do you mean, "shakes me off"?

23
00:01:24,340 --> 00:01:26,300
- So gross.
- Don't say it twice.

24
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Whatever.

25
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,920
I'll head home for today.

26
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:31,140
You can just see me off here.

27
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:33,220
That kid is still waiting for you, right?

28
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,940
See ya.

29
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:46,620
I just can't let go.

30
00:01:57,580 --> 00:02:00,650
"Are the Sexy Buttocks Not Good?"

31
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
(Episode 9)

32
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,160
Hey.

33
00:02:12,620 --> 00:02:13,620
I love you so much.

34
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,800
Did your sister say anything to you?

35
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:17,340
No.

36
00:02:19,180 --> 00:02:21,380
Should we go on a date?

37
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:25,720
Wow, it's so pretty.

38
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,720
What's with that look?

39
00:02:48,820 --> 00:02:49,900
Nothing.

40
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:53,520
Come to think of it,
we haven't really been on a proper date.

41
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:01,540
We can just go on more dates from now on.

42
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Hold this for a sec. Let's take a picture.

43
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:10,640
How is it?

44
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:12,680
- Thanks.
- Yeah.

45
00:03:15,500 --> 00:03:17,020
Come on, smile.

46
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,380
Looks good.

47
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,680
What kind of date do you want?

48
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:30,380
Going to an aquarium or watching a movie.

49
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:36,160
What are you doing?

50
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,660
So cute.

51
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:41,020
I already knew that.

52
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:42,760
I haven't said it enough.

53
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:44,500
Should I shout it out right here?

54
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,000
- So cute!
- Stop it!

55
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,320
Someone will call the cops.

56
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,200
By the way.

57
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:57,300
About earlier.

58
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Earlier?

59
00:04:01,100 --> 00:04:02,100
(Earlier)

60
00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:05,099
(I'm sorry I couldn't say we're dating.)

61
00:04:05,100 --> 00:04:06,100
Ai-chan.

62
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,400
(No.)

63
00:04:08,420 --> 00:04:11,500
(It's my fault for not being able to say
we're in a relationship.)

64
00:04:13,260 --> 00:04:15,460
Did you not like it?

65
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:20,320
That I told my sister
you're my boyfriend.

66
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,040
It's fine.

67
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,960
It'd be weird to hide
it at this point anyway.

68
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,280
(Huh!)

69
00:04:26,340 --> 00:04:28,660
(Then why couldn't I say it?)

70
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,620
For a date, going to a hot
spring would be nice too.

71
00:04:33,626 --> 00:04:35,840
You don't have to
figure it all out at once.

72
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:39,500
Are you by any chance
hiding something bad again?

73
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,320
No, no.

74
00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:48,820
But that day will come eventually.

75
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:53,100
You really are thinking about weird things.

76
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:55,980
Eventually isn't right now.

77
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:59,480
We still have so many things
we can do together in the future.

78
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,870
Until we run out of things to do,

79
00:05:03,330 --> 00:05:05,650
whether it's a hot spring or whatever,
I'll go with you.

80
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,140
However,

81
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,360
it's pretty sexy, right?

82
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:15,500
Ai-chan at a hot spring
would definitely be sexy.

83
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,240
Oh boy.

84
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,280
In a private bath.

85
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,900
Don't go into dirty old man mode.

86
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,920
So sexy.

87
00:05:25,540 --> 00:05:26,540
Sexy.

88
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:32,920
So,

89
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:35,000
are you moving out of here?

90
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:36,960
I haven't decided yet.

91
00:05:37,993 --> 00:05:38,993
It's just that,

92
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:43,080
if I move out,
I'll have to tell my parents.

93
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:46,860
But when I think about
introducing him to my family,

94
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:51,920
I'm not confident I can introduce him
the way Okumi-san did.

95
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,360
Inferiority complex?

96
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,740
Guilt?

97
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:59,200
- That's the one.
- So annoying.

98
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:00,500
Huh?

99
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:03,680
The old guy didn't ask you to
introduce him to your parents.

100
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:06,340
You're just stressing
yourself out over nothing.

101
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:11,200
But Okumi-san introduced me to his sister
as his boyfriend.

102
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:13,140
Yet I...

103
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:19,080
So you're going to tell your parents you're
dating a guy, who's not only an older man,

104
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:22,320
but also the boss of your company?

105
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,180
Even if things are going well now,

106
00:06:29,780 --> 00:06:32,920
who knows if you'll stay together forever.

107
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,180
The future, huh.

108
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:39,100
Introducing him to your parents...

109
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:42,240
I feel like that's the final hurdle.

110
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,580
The future.

111
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:51,640
I thought I'd always be
with Okumi-san in the future too.

112
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:53,920
I see.

113
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:57,880
When he becomes an old man,
I have to be the one by his side.

114
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:02,200
And I haven't really thought
about what happens after that.

115
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:05,400
As for introducing him to my parents...

116
00:07:06,860 --> 00:07:09,880
Didn't you want to keep
it a secret from them?

117
00:07:11,180 --> 00:07:14,800
I don't think I want to hide it.

118
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:19,080
Though I'm not entirely sure myself.

119
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,660
I want my parents to meet Okumi-san.

120
00:07:22,420 --> 00:07:24,660
I want to properly talk to
them about the person I love.

121
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:27,930
These feelings aren't a lie.

122
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:34,080
You're so conflicted,
yet surprisingly resolute.

123
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:37,920
Thanks for listening to me.

124
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,760
Whether to let my parents know
or how to introduce our relationship,

125
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:50,060
none of that matters.

126
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:52,000
What matters is what I want to do.

127
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:56,520
And what I want to do right now is...

128
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,900
Welcome back.

129
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:05,920
Ai-chan.

130
00:08:07,090 --> 00:08:08,090
I want to do it.

131
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:09,520
Huh?

132
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:14,960
Even if I can't see the future,

133
00:08:18,820 --> 00:08:21,080
even if I'm not fully prepared for it,

134
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:24,800
I want to be with this person forever.

135
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:45,340
Am I being too greedy?

136
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,240
What's wrong?

137
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:53,100
I want all of Okumi-san.

138
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:58,400
Don't you already have it?

139
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,180
Wait.

140
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:24,300
Today, I want to make Okumi-san feel it.

141
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:03,800
I want to be with this person.

142
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:19,480
I'm planning to move out of my apartment.

143
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:20,919
Huh?

144
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:21,920
Are you serious?

145
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:25,780
You asked knowing I'd turn down
living together, right?

146
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:27,480
No.

147
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:32,719
You actually want to live together, but you're
wondering if it's okay to make me go that far.

148
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:35,619
- Right?
- When did you learn to read minds?

149
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:36,620
I didn't.

150
00:11:37,140 --> 00:11:39,460
I pretty much know
what the person I love is thinking.

151
00:11:41,180 --> 00:11:45,880
Does the person you love mean me?

152
00:11:46,820 --> 00:11:48,000
Who else could it be?

153
00:11:49,340 --> 00:11:50,620
Ai-chan.

154
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:54,720
I...

155
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,660
I love Okumi-san.

156
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:02,920
- Ouch.
- Sorry, sorry.

157
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:05,919
I guess I was too hasty after all.

158
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:06,920
No.

159
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,360
I'm really happy.

160
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:12,080
But it was so sudden, it startled me.

161
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:20,640
Because I realized my own feelings.

162
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:40,600
I have to contact my parents and tell them

163
00:12:40,601 --> 00:12:42,360
I'm moving out of my apartment.

164
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:45,060
Right now? So suddenly?

165
00:12:47,230 --> 00:12:49,900
Mom, I'm doing great.

166
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:01,740
Um,

167
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:04,320
there's someone I want to live with.

168
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,456
(Preview for the Final Episode)
He's my boyfriend.

169
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:11,500
Who would hand our Ai-chan over
to a man like this?

170
00:13:11,700 --> 00:13:14,360
I want to cherish Okumi-san properly.

171
00:13:14,860 --> 00:13:16,319
Don't go anywhere.

172
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,980
I'm right by your side.

173
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:19,380
I'm not going anywhere.
